  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Yabusame" id="e66e-375b-51e7-8e99" hidden="false">
      <description>If this Unit has performed both a Move and Dash Action this Round, it may perform a Free Aim Action.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="G.R.A.I.L" id="f23f-0a11-4bd8-e2f1" hidden="true">
      <description>During the first Command Phase, roll 5 dice, and then set them aside in a pool. Reroll any duplicates until all 5 are unique. These are your G.R.A.I.L dice.


At any point during the game before you are to roll dice, a G.R.A.I.L die may be used to replace the result of one die. (This is considered to be an unmodified roll.)


You may not spend more than one G.R.A.I.L dice per roll or check. 


You may not have more than 5 G.R.A.I.L dice at a time. If you would gain more than 5, replace one of the dice in your existing pool.


Whenever you spend an Intel Point, you may roll a 7+ check to gain a G.R.A.I.L die.</description>
      <modifiers>
        <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="false">
          <conditionGroups>
            <conditionGroup type="and">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="01ba-2120-7904-bce7" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
                <condition childId="381c-41bb-e273-4cf0" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="primary-catalogue" shared="true" type="instanceOf" value="1"/>
              </conditions>
            </conditionGroup>
          </conditionGroups>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
