            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Objective Acquired" id="d68c-a6c9-3225-6674" hidden="false">
              <description>As an Action, Captain Kaeda Goemon may pick up an Uncontested Objective you control that it is in base-to-base contact with. While holding this Objective, the Objective moves with Captain Kaeda Goemon as if it were a squad member in cohesion. Captain Kaeda Goemon may not take the Move Action while holding the Objective, but may take the Dash Action. If Captain Kaeda Goemon is your Field Commander, Units with the IJN Keyword on the Objective he is holding count as double their HP for the purpose of holding or capturing Objectives.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
