            <rule name="Deashi" id="dec3-b2e5-3b68-08d6" hidden="false">
              <description>When this Unit performs an Attack action with the Charge! Special Rule, after resolving the Attack, roll a D5 for each model in this Unit, and add the total health of this Unit to the result of those rolls. If this number is greater than the total health of the Engaged Unit, you may choose for the Engaged Unit to be moved up to 3&quot; away from this one, in a direction of your choosing, to a valid location.</description>
